<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ballantyne EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ballantyne EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--L.H. Friend, Weinress, Frankson &amp; Presson Inc said Friday it raised its estimates on Ballantyne of Omaha Inc to $0.79 from $0.77 per share for 1997 and to $0.96 from $0.92 for 1998.</p>
<p>--It also reiterated a strong buy on Ballantyne, a manufacturer and supplier of high intensity searchlights.</p>
<p>--L.H. Friend's 12-month price target on the stock is $20.</p>
<p>--Ballantyne of Omaha ended off 1/4 at 15-5/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
